WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.092
Time travel starts on the dance floor.

00:00:02.495 --> 00:00:06.904
Pick a decade and listen to what changes
when the DJ drops the first track.

00:00:07.303 --> 00:00:10.737
Every Retro Glam Sessions
edition is built around one era.

00:00:11.135 --> 00:00:13.676
A seventies disco night
has a different sound,

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:17.110
lighting design and atmosphere
from an eighties neon party.

00:00:17.509 --> 00:00:22.316
We carry that idea through the live stage,
the DJ set and the photo moments.

00:00:22.715 --> 00:00:26.053
Guests step into a room designed
around the music they came to hear.

00:00:26.451 --> 00:00:29.501
Our producers coordinate décor,
multimedia,

00:00:29.899 --> 00:00:32.330
catering, staffing and logistics.

00:00:32.729 --> 00:00:36.973
We select the vendors and call their cues
so the whole night moves as one show.

00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:40.957
Each year, we produce more than
two hundred and fifty small

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:44.487
and midsize events,
in addition to our corporate productions.

00:00:44.885 --> 00:00:47.042
That experience shapes every edition.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:48.374
Pick your decade.

00:00:48.773 --> 00:00:51.877
Join the priority list,
ask about a private edition,

00:00:52.358 --> 00:00:54.473
or tell us how your brand
would like to take part.
